WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:16.369
Emmy wore a uniform, a hat, and running shoes.

2
00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:22.705
Today was her big track meet.

3
00:00:22.706 --> 00:00:28.055
"It's so windy," Harry said.

4
00:00:28.056 --> 00:00:31.763
"You're lucky," Emmy said.

5
00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:38.826
"You don't have to compete in this wind!"

6
00:00:38.827 --> 00:00:42.809
"What events are you doing?" Mom asked.

7
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:47.152
"Two races and the high jump," Emmy said.

8
00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:50.767
The family drove to the meet.

9
00:00:50.768 --> 00:00:53.686
Emmy found her teammates.

10
00:00:53.687 --> 00:00:58.981
Mom, Dad, Harry, and Oliver sat in the stands.

11
00:00:58.982 --> 00:01:01.975
Suddenly Emmy ran over.

12
00:01:01.976 --> 00:01:05.984
"I left my water bottle in the car!"

13
00:01:05.985 --> 00:01:10.030
"I'll get it," Harry said.

14
00:01:10.031 --> 00:01:14.504
Harry ran as fast as he could.

15
00:01:14.505 --> 00:01:17.906
When he got back, he was out of breath.

16
00:01:17.907 --> 00:01:21.460
He gave Emmy her water bottle.

17
00:01:21.461 --> 00:01:25.892
It was almost time for Emmy's first race.

18
00:01:25.893 --> 00:01:29.325
The wind blew.

19
00:01:29.326 --> 00:01:32.921
Emmy's jacket flew over the fence.

20
00:01:32.922 --> 00:01:38.245
"My jacket!" Emmy cried.

21
00:01:38.246 --> 00:01:41.298
"I'll get it!" Harry said.

22
00:01:41.299 --> 00:01:43.974
Harry ran fast.

23
00:01:43.975 --> 00:01:46.930
He jumped over the fence!

24
00:01:46.931 --> 00:01:55.276
He gave Emmy her jacket.

25
00:01:55.277 --> 00:01:59.565
Another wind blew.

26
00:01:59.566 --> 00:02:03.720
Emmy's hat tumbled across the track.

27
00:02:03.721 --> 00:02:08.808
Harry ran and grabbed it.

28
00:02:08.809 --> 00:02:10.869
"Emmy, catch!"

29
00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:14.242
Harry threw the hat like a discus.

30
00:02:14.243 --> 00:02:17.940
Emmy caught it.

31
00:02:17.941 --> 00:02:21.777
Finally Emmy's track meet was over.

32
00:02:21.778 --> 00:02:25.912
"I'm so tired!" Emmy said.

33
00:02:25.913 --> 00:02:35.359
Harry moaned. "So am I!"
